---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Highlight notes
description: Presenter notes and likely questions from the passkeys talk.
permalink: /notes/
---

<section class="site-shell content-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Presenter reference</p>
  <h1>Highlight notes</h1>
  <p class="lede">Likely questions, emphasis points, and build notes collected across the slide sequence.</p>

  {% for slide in talk.slides %}
    {% if slide.notes %}
      <section class="content-panel notes-panel" aria-labelledby="notes-slide-{{ slide.number }}">
        <h2 id="notes-slide-{{ slide.number }}"><a href="{{ slide | slidePath | url }}">Slide {{ slide.number }}: {{ slide.title }}</a></h2>
        {% for note in slide.notes %}
          <aside class="note-callout">
            <strong>{{ note.title }}:</strong> {{ note.body }}
          </aside>
        {% endfor %}
      </section>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
